"""assets.py — self-contained, CSP-safe embedded typefaces for the cockpit.

The Artifact/Pages CSP blocks external font hosts, so the cockpit inlines its faces as
base64 data-URI @font-face rules. Faces are latin subsets restricted to the glyphs the
dashboard actually uses (see scratch subsetting), keeping the payload ~57KB total.

Pairing (grounded in the subject — a diabetes-reversal instrument that is also a human
story): **Fraunces** (a warm, authoritative modern serif) carries the narrative/hero;
**Geist** (a precise technical sans) is the UI/body voice; **Geist Mono** sets figures.
"""

